      {
        "name": "skipNullOn",
        "optional": true,
        "defaultValue": "None",
        "description": "Skips `null` values in the specified data structure. By default, DataWeave does not skip the values.\n\n* `arrays` + Ignore and omit `null` values inside arrays from the YAML output, for example, with `output application/yaml skipNullOn=\"arrays\"`.\n* `objects` + Ignore key-value pairs that have `null` as the value, for example, with `output application/yaml skipNullOn=\"objects\"`.\n* `everywhere` + Apply `skipNullOn` to arrays and objects, for example, `output application/yaml skipNullOn=\"everywhere\"`.\n",
